`★ Insight ─────────────────────────────────────`
- Bean bags use two overlapping ellipsoids: a wide flat one for the body (radii 10,8,10) and a smaller squashed one at the top (radii 7,3,7) to simulate the sitting depression
- The ellipsoid `E` primitive is ideal here — `S` (sphere) would look too rigid, while `E` lets you independently control X/Y/Z radii for organic shapes
- The maroon (`e`) base patch grounds the object visually against the dark renderer background without using black (`0`)
`─────────────────────────────────────────────────`
